*   **charge\_speed\_kw**: Supports AC charging up to 3.7 kW (Source [5, 9]). Optional DC fast charging up to 55 kW is mentioned for the C300e (Source [4] - C300e data), but not explicitly confirmed for the C63 S E Performance in the provided sources. Assuming standard AC charging is slow for a PHEV. Score: -0.80.
